flowchart TD
  A[Validate exported CA] --> B{Matches running Caddy?}
  B -- no --> X[Fail and stop]
  B -- yes --> C{System trust action}
  C -- already trusted --> N[Check NSS ownership]
  C -- manual or declined --> N
  C -- confirmed --> D[Root reads validated stdin]
  D --> E{Bundle verified?}
  E -- no --> X
  E -- yes --> N
  N --> F[Import validated stdin]
  F --> G{Certificate readback matches?}
  G -- no --> X
  G -- yes --> H[Write host bundle]
